the-firm-as-one-program-46 = pull the-firm-as-one-program-source (whole the-firm-as-one-program-source) (cons (span #21276 #21741) nil) (restated (unlines (cons "  - **PE4** Specialize across the consumer: fusion. [C4: The fast path is a specialization that carries its proof ([P5], [P7])]" (cons "    - **PE4.1** Fields the strategy never reads are never decoded." (cons "    - **PE4.2** The intermediate message struct disappears; the strategy runs directly on the receive buffer (deforestation across the producer/consumer boundary)." (cons "    - **PE4.3** Impossible across teams by hand, since the parser cannot know every consumer; exact in one program. The first concrete instance of end-to-end optimization. [O7: Nothing in computer science is not developed fully here; this was the three-year study of the industry before execution. Optimization, end-to-end optimization]" nil)))))) as-written
