the-firm-as-one-program-75 : Pull
the-firm-as-one-program-75 = pull the-firm-as-one-program-source (whole the-firm-as-one-program-source) (cons (span #30465 #30925) nil) (restated (unlines (cons "- **V14** Proof sold to clients and regulators as a product ([C1: Prove any provable property of the whole firm ([P2], [P6], [P7])], [C8: Audit trails and compliance are queries over retained effect histories ([P8])])." (cons "  Brokers that route retail flow to a market maker must show best execution, and the arrangements are under constant scrutiny. A firm that can hand brokers and regulators a proof that each order was handled by stated rules, at a stated price, against stated market conditions, offers something no competitor can, and the trust of clients becomes something established by construction." nil)))) as-written
